{"id":"9cb9b7f106aade8c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-prop-tukey.md","title":"Tukey Ordering","display":"prop-tukey — Tukey Ordering","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-tukey","aliases":["58-prop-tukey"],"display":"prop-tukey — Tukey Ordering","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-tukey"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-tukey</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-tukey — Tukey Ordering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9b9175a5a31065e\" href=\"?note=c9b9175a5a31065e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P),(Q,\\leq_Q)\">\\((P,\\leq_P),(Q,\\leq_Q)\\)</span> (partial orders, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathrm{Tk}}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathrm{Tk}}\\)</span> (Tukey preorder)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\)</span> (partial-order predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S\\)</span> (cofinal-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c9b9175a5a31065e\" href=\"?note=c9b9175a5a31065e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash (P,\\leq_P)\\preceq_{\\mathrm{Tk}}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartOrd}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(f,Q,P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq Q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,Q,\\leq_Q)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(f[C],P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}tukey}\\vdash (P,\\leq_P)\\preceq_{\\mathrm{Tk}}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartOrd}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(f,Q,P)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq Q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,Q,\\leq_Q)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(f[C],P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom fixes the convention that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\preceq_{\\mathrm{Tk}}Q\">\\(P\\preceq_{\\mathrm{Tk}}Q\\)</span> is witnessed by a cofinal map from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The witnessing map need not be order preserving; adding monotonicity would define a stronger relation for arbitrary directed orders.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9b9175a5a31065e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(P,\\leq_P),(Q,\\leq_Q)$ (partial orders, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9b9175a5a31065e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","e